[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869829060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106274#issuecomment-2869829060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106274","id":2869829060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rDh3E","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-11T12:35:08Z","updated_at":"2025-05-11T12:35:08Z","body":">     func _draw():\n> \t    var font = FontFile.new()\n> \t    font = load(\"res://font/simkai.ttf\")\n> \t    draw_string(font, Vector2(100, 100), \"Hello, Godot 4!\")\n\nAFAICT the issue is that `font` is a local variable, and hence it's destructor is being called when exiting the method scope (as Resources are RefCounted and there is no other references making such font not be freed). In such destructor the TextServer side resources are being freed, making the issued rendering draw commands refer to invalid/freed data.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/19bb18716ef08b811fec330cba4d35fbdb027bcc/scene/resources/font.cpp#L2817-L2819\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/19bb18716ef08b811fec330cba4d35fbdb027bcc/scene/resources/font.cpp#L577-L584\n\nAll you'd need to do is to make the used font not be freed as long as you're using it, e.g. by holding a reference to it in the class scope:\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\t\nvar font: Font = load(\"res://font/simkai.ttf\")\n\nfunc _draw():\n\tdraw_string(font, Vector2(100, 100), \"Hello, Godot 4!\")\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869829060/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2869833499","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106274#issuecomment-2869833499","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106274","id":2869833499,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rDi8b","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-11T12:46:29Z","u